{"game": "risk-of-rain-returns", "language": "english", "appid": 1337520, "month": "2026-09", "window": 2, "start_date": 1788825600, "end_date": 1789516799, "month_true_total": 48, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 00:56:05 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "235294009", "author": {"steamid": "76561198321747413", "personaname": "SiffrinStarlight (She/They)", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/maethedoctor/", "num_games_owned": 253, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 1112, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1093, "last_played": 1789450259, "avatar": "cac5c907d9d093b4c52de1b746d100da8237d79b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Risk of Rain Returns is probably my favourite Risk of Rain-\n\nI know there's only two (technically), and Risk of Rain 2 is widely more popular and it has more content and it has more mods and it has more people and blah-blah-blah.\n\nI simply just adore the pixel art in this game~ :3 I think it's super pretty~ I love all the portraits for the Survivors~ And I really like the music~ I adore this game greatly~ Especially because I get to play Drifter in it!!!~ :D (I don't have Alloyed Collective yet~ :P )\n\nI also really like the idea of the Providence Trials, I think seeing something similar in RoR2 to unlock more Skins or even skills again would be really cool!!!!~ :D (even if some of the Trials in RoR:R are kinda bs.... -.- )", "timestamp_created": 1789423351, "timestamp_updated": 1789423351, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.591584146022796631", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "235260320", "author": {"steamid": "76561198404006713", "personaname": "Bluest Baby", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamc